    "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-2045\" src=\"https://cfi.co/awards/wp-content/uploads/2012/10/bi1.jpg\" alt=\"bi\" width=\"348\" height=\"77\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>The role that Banco Interacciones plays in the Mexican economy should not be underestimated. </strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Bank plays a major role in financing the public sector and by maintaining a clearly defined strategy has produced excellent results for all Stakeholders.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The bank provides viable solutions for investment, credit and risk management requirements and CFI.co is pleased to declare the bank as the Best Investment Bank Mexico and Best Government Bank Mexico.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Banco Interacciones  is an excellent example of how a streamlined and focused bank can produce outstanding results and help with sustainable development of a domestic market.</p>",
